    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7a8fa255bc6e123afa4ed87",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但也正因如此，我也不该强硬地敲开她的心房。\n首先，还是应该建立起彼此的信任关系——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c960d765efc532849cc6744e80b783fad4c90621af28d1321cf9bb4f7cb4f340",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ace242cad683bca49ffa915d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，现在正有一件不得不做好的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "795847c2d23ea1f0f59f03fd56ed0f882362df3223c712cf2e0e0cee569bd85e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8212057f7b7c9ee78315d2b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是真正亲眼见过爱慕织姬的训练之后，\n我才了解到的事情。她——",
      "source_fingerprint": "cea54987387fa3044e1341ee182ce7f4e4709cc7d23634081c2a86a079c90d53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b206c5a03536593b97a12d07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "骏川手纲",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af4d8dceb5b92eca19c220cc5ecbdab6c87e57af2351e847017bc4a33d059a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2405bd0185620fd9d5ae0fed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此，是想要减轻她脚部骨骼歪曲带来的\r\n多余负担……吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "396d017728711b7512a7cfdf221e7b6d4040261f55fa0e49f56f77d20263c2b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67a2195dfe177148fd7e1d03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好像是天生的吧，她的左脚稍微有些歪曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6f2811a93ffb95a2917e298a2f2b5db13ff41178076a8b912ea0ebe429e6bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f83d2d21441d1db26ee044ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "骏川手纲",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af4d8dceb5b92eca19c220cc5ecbdab6c87e57af2351e847017bc4a33d059a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98757caf65cd9e410a099268",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "的确，我此前观摩爱慕织姬同学的奔跑时，\r\n也感觉她跑步时的姿势稍微有些歪斜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fbf6058f18789fcd9985d2d0ec74e4991f86d69bb9e61fe1f8b3ecc0a36103e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2885288e71cd0df7fd790e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的脚部骨骼似乎有些天生的歪曲。\r\n这影响了她平日里站立、行走和跑步的姿势，\r\n并且也给她的脚部带来了多余的负担。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40ee51de9e11d6ca3dc35b82dc834e26b47f2ffd214ce4f69222f7dd58db2f9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d639b2eed3a6b17ad3b064a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "除此之外，根据我事先拿到的资料来看——\r\n她脚底的皮肤较之常人也显得更薄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba1b36ab17457023457066146821162d01c6ce777df9ca7d219ed4299bf2dc5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bc9df5920c201ee2250bc1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想减轻她的负担，哪怕只有这点程度也好…",
      "source_fingerprint": "81633fbfe81ccc446b4ac9ade96f21bbc71b9b4aefa6ae49cf601619def85e2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcfdc450ae8c41d86341752f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为她既认真又不愿给人添麻烦，\r\n一直都自己一个人对腿部进行着护理，\r\n所以暂时没出现过什么大问题……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7176610ce135eeed8015584bca4b37a34071f562544ca82a8f67918f045aabb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9fb9bcc8aecd1545a604f64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "骏川手纲",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af4d8dceb5b92eca19c220cc5ecbdab6c87e57af2351e847017bc4a33d059a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
