    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b48107110834d2d66b014c6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是有什么我帮得上忙的地方，请尽管告诉我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b93fab9b7157387f316905e49e71d7c7cd79072a75c2e1939282dc94177c39b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8c545860ded02662611885",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然她每天进行的护理就已经足够了的话……\r\n那么，也许该尝试着从根本上解决问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c70bcfb40962041bffd1cdaed627d2e18e902e3422d8a3fc25c400ee0d1e2ef3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126c3c87533276167563f4e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与手纲小姐讨论了一会后，\r\n得出的结论是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7715c558a2cc4a5da11a675c62ae51ba72375f18cd71bb7abeee138484df47ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
